<section id="faq" class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="faq">
            <!-- Outer groups: all share name="faq" -->
            <details name="faq">
                <summary class="outer">Getting started</summary>
                <div class="faq-inner">
                    <details name="faq-start">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >What information do you need from me to get started
                            on a project?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            I typically need a clear description of your project
                            goals, target audience, any design preferences,
                            technical requirements, and timeline expectations.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            The more details you can provide, the better I can
                            tailor my approach.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            For larger projects, I'll provide a detailed
                            questionnaire to help you articulate your vision.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I'm also happy to schedule an initial consultation
                            call to discuss your needs more thoroughly.
                        </p>
                        <a class="btn" href="#contact" style="margin-top:1rem;"
                            >Schedule a Consultation</a
                        >
                    </details>
                    <details name="faq-start">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >Have you worked with businesses in my industry
                            before?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            I've worked with clients across diverse industries
                            including healthcare, real estate, digital
                            marketing, and others.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            While each industry has unique requirements, my
                            experience has taught me how to quickly adapt to
                            different business domains.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            For industries new to me, I invest time in research
                            to understand your specific challenges and
                            standards.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            My portfolio includes examples of past work that
                            demonstrate my versatility across sectors.
                        </p>
                        <a class="btn" href="#contact" style="margin-top:1rem;"
                            >Contact Me</a
                        >
                    </details>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details name="faq">
                <summary class="outer">Project Planning and Execution</summary>
                <div class="faq-inner">
                    <details name="faq-planning">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >How do you prioritize features when working within
                            budget constraints?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            I use a value-driven approach to feature
                            prioritization.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            We'll collaborate to identify "must-have" versus
                            "nice-to-have" features based on your business goals
                            and user needs.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I will then implement core functionality first, then
                            add enhancements as the budget allows. This approach
                            ensures you get a functional product that delivers
                            value, even with limited resources.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I'm transparent about what's achievable within your
                            budget and can suggest phased implementations if
                            needed. Please contact me to discuss this further
                        </p>
                        <a class="btn" href="#contact" style="margin-top:1rem;"
                            >Contact Me</a
                        >
                    </details>
                    <details name="faq-planning">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >How long does a typical project take from start to
                            finish?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            Project timelines vary based on complexity and
                            scope.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Simple websites typically take 1-2 weeks, while more
                            complex web applications may require 1-3 months.
                            E-commerce solutions generally take 1.5-3 months
                            depending on customization needs.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            After our initial consultation, I'll provide a
                            detailed timeline with key milestones. I'm committed
                            to meeting agreed-upon deadlines while maintaining
                            quality standards.
                        </p>
                    </details>
                    <details name="faq-planning">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >How do you communicate progress throughout the
                            development process?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            I believe in transparent, consistent communication.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            You'll receive weekly progress updates for longer
                            projects and daily progress updates for shorter ones
                            via email, and we'll have scheduled check-in calls
                            at key milestones.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I also use project management tools that give you
                            visibility into task completion and upcoming work.
                            This approach ensures you're always in the loop.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            For day-to-day communication, I'm available through
                            your preferred channel (email, Discord, Slack,
                            etc.). My goal is to keep you informed without
                            overwhelming you with technical details unless
                            neccessary.
                        </p>
                        <a class="btn" href="#contact" style="margin-top:1rem;"
                            >Contact Me</a
                        >
                    </details>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details name="faq">
                <summary class="outer">Timelines and pricing</summary>
                <div class="faq-inner">
                    <details name="faq-pricing">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >What is your pricing structure? Do you charge
                            hourly, fixed-price, or use another model?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            Add your typical timelines here, for example a
                            custom theme in 3 to 5 weeks and a web application
                            in 6 to 12.
                        </p>
                    </details>
                    <details name="faq-pricing">
                        <summary class="inner">How is pricing set?</summary>
                        <p>
                            I offer flexible pricing options tailored to your
                            project needs:
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                Fixed-price contracts for well-defined projects
                                with clear requirements
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Hourly rates for exploratory work or projects
                                with evolving scopes
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Retainer arrangements for ongoing development
                                needs
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            For most client projects, I prefer fixed-price
                            agreements as they provide budget certainty.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            After our initial consultation, I'll recommend the
                            most appropriate pricing model and provide a
                            detailed proposal.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            All pricing options include regular milestones and
                            deliverables to ensure transparency.
                        </p>
                    </details>
                    <details name="faq-pricing">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >How do you handle change requests during a project?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            I understand requirements can and do evolve as
                            projects progress and minor adjustments are
                            accommodated within the original agreement.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            For substantial changes, I'll assess the impact on
                            timeline and budget, then provide you with options
                            before proceeding.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I document all change requests and maintain a change
                            log that's accessible to you. This approach ensures
                            transparency while allowing flexibility for your
                            evolving needs.
                        </p>
                    </details>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details name="faq">
                <summary class="outer">Support and Maintenance</summary>
                <div class="faq-inner">
                    <details name="faq-support">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >What is your availability for ongoing maintenance
                            and support after project completion?</summary
                        >
                        <p>I offer several post-launch support options:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                A 30-day warranty period for all projects to
                                address any immediate issues
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Monthly maintenance packages for regular updates
                                and minor improvements
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Priority support agreements for
                                business-critical applications
                            </li>
                            <li>Ad-hoc support at my standard hourly rate</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            I recommend discussing maintenance needs early in
                            the project planning phase so we can build with
                            long-term support in mind. My goal is to ensure your
                            solution remains secure, performant, and up-to-date.
                        </p>
                    </details>
                    <details name="faq-support">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >What's your process for handling urgent issues or
                            emergency fixes?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            For clients with support agreements, I provide a
                            dedicated channel for reporting urgent issues with
                            guaranteed response times (typically within 1-4
                            hours depending on your support tier).
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            For clients without support agreements, you can
                            contact me at anytime and we will schedule a time to
                            discuss the issue. My availability is flexible and
                            I'll do my best to respond within one business day.
                        </p>
                    </details>
                    <details name="faq-support">
                        <summary class="inner"
                            >Do you offer any guarantees or warranties on your
                            work?</summary
                        >
                        <p>
                            Yes, all my work comes with a 30-day warranty period
                            after project completion. During this time, I'll fix
                            any bugs or issues at no additional cost.
                        </p>
                        <p>I also guarantee:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Code that follows industry best practices</li>
                            <li>
                                Cross-browser compatibility as specified in our
                                agreement
                            </li>
                            <li>Responsive design for mobile devices</li>
                            <li>Adherence to accessibility guidelines</li>
                            <li>Secure coding practices</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            My contracts clearly outline what's covered under
                            warranty and what would constitute billable changes
                            or enhancements. Contact me if you need further
                            clarification or have a question about these
                            guarantees.
                        </p>
                        <a class="btn" href="#contact" style="margin-top:1rem;"
                            >Contact Me</a
                        >
                    </details>
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
